				</rdf:Seq>
			</dc:creator>
			<dc:description>
				<rdf:Alt>
					<rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">The primary objective of this userâ€™s manual is to describe the functionality of the e200z3 embedded microprocessor core for software and hardware developers. This book is intended as a companion to the EREF: A Programmer's Reference Manual for Freescale Book E Processors (hereafter referred to as EREF). Supports e200z3 e200z335.</rdf:li>
